	(text "R705 (0.01 Ohm) causes a 10 mV/A drop. Feedback and PG_SYS refer to SYS_RAW\nbefore the shunt. U701 is a 5 A IC with internal current, short-circuit and\nthermal protection. At 5 A, R705 dissipates 0.25 W: verify thermal margin.\nD701 indicates rail presence."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "02c14d1a-59d4-44e3-8472-ca218a50eec9")
	)
	(text "R703/R704: 3.315 V nominal at RAW. R705: 10 mV/A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22 151 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "266108fd-dad4-49e3-8493-f3b6a49d624c")
	)
	(text "R703 (100 kOhm) and R704 (43.2 kOhm) set SYS_RAW:\nVRAW = VREF x (1 + R703/R704).\nWith VREF = 1 V, VRAW = 3.315 V (3.335 V using the typical 1.006 V PWM\nreference). To change voltage: R703 = R704 x (VRAW/VREF - 1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "402c7b46-0321-4ad6-9288-42181a3f6d98")
	)
	(text "BUS24 feeds U701 (LM76005RNPR). CMD_SYS drives Q701 as an active-high source\nfollower; R702 (100 kOhm) pulls EN_SYS low when Q701 is off. R701 (10 kOhm)\npulls the open-drain PG_SYS output up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 65.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e2c2728-bb46-48d6-a8e3-6e9c8ebae848")
	)
	(text "CMD_SYS drives EN through Q701.\nPG_SYS is pulled up to AON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92 33.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "612ac0cf-d61e-4a38-8346-f5bbb629d5f9")
	)
