	(text "RT is open: nominal switching frequency is 400 kHz. MODE is grounded: PFM is\nallowed at light load. C703 (22 nF) extends soft-start. L701 (6.8 uH) and\nC708-C713 (6 x 47 uF) filter SYS_RAW; C714 shapes the feedback response."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 90.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7df8b8e7-dab1-4e09-9edf-120b29a1efaa")
	)
	(text "Generates SYS3V3 from BUS24 for system logic. CMD_SYS enables the supply;\nPG_SYS reports regulator power-good status to external control circuitry."
